From 7c118ab0ba127c56845a7a9e5ed0ee230436e9ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:19:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: rkisp2: Add the wide dynamic range algorithm

Port the RkISP1 wide dynamic range algorithm to the RkISP2 IPA. It runs
the WDR block of the ISP 2.0 in global mode, with the tone curve the
WdrMode, WdrStrength and WdrMaxBrightPixels controls select, takes its
histogram from the HIST_BIG0 statistics the AGC uses, and adds its
bright pixel constraint to the AGC while WDR is on. The block mode
settings are written with their hardware reset values.

List the algorithm in the imx415 tuning, off by default, with the
exposure constraint of the RkISP1 default.

Assisted-by: LLM
